From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: robyroro <41092915+robyroro@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:11:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] webui: register Shade's protections page

chrome://protections.top-chrome is Shade's protections panel. Chromium
registers each WebUI page in lists with no hook, so this adds it to them:
its config (chrome_web_ui_configs.cc), its Mojo binder
(chrome_browser_interface_binders_webui.cc, through
ghost::protections::PopulateWebUIFrameBinders), its pak
(chrome_paks.gni), its grd's resource ids (resource_ids.spec), its name
on the top-chrome allow-list (the .Protections variant in
histograms.xml, read at compile time by WebUIContentsWrapperT; Shade
sends no metrics), and Lit's visibility list for Shade's pages.

Why: WebUI pages are registered in Chromium's own lists only.
Upstream: not upstreamable: product-specific UI
Signed-off-by: robyroro <41092915+robyroro@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
index 314ca5155ad9d472126264c9612e0789bff85531..7f6a45f41d29ca53c2eff211e58ab04e0422b14a 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
@@ -1376,6 +1376,7 @@ source_set("core") {
 
   if (!is_android || is_desktop_android) {
     deps += [ "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/discards" ]
+    deps += [ "//ghost/browser/ui/protections" ]
   }
 
   if (enable_dice_support || is_chromeos) {
diff --git a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders_webui.cc b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_interface_binders_webui.cc
index b9138786293c3448ac21850f6820755f96adc01e..4df1cc26ede9756883992be401dde8435b9fed23 100644
